in respect of returns prepared and furnished by him maintain record of the following, namely:-
(i)
the name of assessees whose returns have been prepared and furnished by him during that month;
(ii)
the Service Tax Code(STC) number and premises code of such assessees;
(iii)
period for which return is filed;
(iv)
date of furnishing the return;
(v)
authority with whom return is filed;
(vi)
amount of tax payable;
(vii)
amount of tax paid;
(viii)
the fee charged and received by him
(g)
furnish a statement of particulars mentioned in item (vi) for every month on or before the seventh day of the immediately
following month to the Resource Centre.
